# Edit FlowKernel.lean -> port the delta to FlowDialect.lean, then
# re-pin: sha256sum of the LF-normalized bytes (checkouts disagree on
# line endings; the pin is over \r-stripped content so either side of
# a core.autocrlf boundary compares equal).
